The local scan service registered every analyzer and post handler through
pkg/fanal/analyzer/all and pkg/fanal/handler/all. The wrapper registers only
the ones it can enable (analyzers.go), so the blank imports go.

It also imported pkg/iac/rego for one helper, inlined here, and
pkg/detector/ospkg for a sentinel error that only vulnerability detection
returns (see 06-scan-without-vulnerability-detection.patch).

